The licence above covers this repository's own files: the program around the
emulator (waterbox/), the tests and the documents.

It does not cover Gambatte. libgambatte (extern/gambatte-core, a submodule)
is Gambatte-Speedrun, the Pokemon speedrunning community's fork of Sindre
Aamas's Gambatte, under the GNU General Public License, version 2. It carries
Shay Green's snes_spc, for the Super Game Boy's sound, under the GNU Lesser
General Public License, version 2.1 or later. Any file under patches/ is a
change to gambatte-core and is under the GPL 2 as well.

The built package, gambatte.chimeraCore, holds libgambatte compiled together
with this repository's program, and is distributed under the GNU General
Public License version 2. It holds no boot ROM of Nintendo's and no game.
